The Council Hall (corona): an imposing monumental hexagonal structure, seat of the Council of agents.
Written by Gemini CLI (Gemini 3.8 Flash, subscription) on 23/10/2026, task T19.
Box: 20 × 20 × 9 tiles, 160 × 160 × 72 voxels, 8 voxels per tile.
Key letters:
  O = door (letter O, name "porta", at the centre x=80, y=131, z=0..23, inner hall empty for over 20 voxels)
  F = sign ("SALA DEL CONCILIO", pink neon ff8ad8 with a steady glow above the monumental portal)
  P = dark matte plate for the sign
  M = primary black metal (corner pylons, lintels, fins and plinths)
  m = dark secondary metal (profiles, pilasters and panels)
  C = monumental graphite concrete (steps, staircase and terraces)
  S = light steel / pilasters and structural joints
  s = dark steel (frames and floor inlays)
  V = dark reflecting glass
  v = bands of cold bluish reflection
  w = bands of warm magenta reflection
  n = soft pink neon for frames (glow)
  N = bright pink neon for the portal and the lantern (glow)
  x = temporary buffer for the animation (hidden)
Pulsing phases of the pink neon (1..8):
  1..8 = continuous gradient of 8 phases (from 8a2862 to ffa0e2) with the wave of the Council's deliberation.
Architecture:
  Monumental hexagonal plan (side 56 voxels, footprint 120 × 104 voxels, z=2..42), with 6 massive polygonal vertical
  pylons at the corners and the main facade to the south facing the avenue.
Monumental portal:
  Monumental forward block (x=64..96, y=118..134, z=0..38) 4 tiles high with grooved side fins in metal and steel,
  door O centred at x=80 and a big sign "SALA DEL CONCILIO" on two lines above the portal.
Roof and top lantern:
  Roof in hexagonal steps (z=42..65) rising towards the central lantern with a pulsing pink core and a spire at z=70.
Inside the Hall:
  A wide council chamber with a graphite marble floor, the Council's central round table with the stations of the 8 agents
  and a rotating hologram of the universe.
Animation "delibera" (8 frames):
  A fluid energy wave pulsing along the six vertical edges, the monumental portal and the zenith lantern.
-->
